      "arabic": "١١٦٣١- فسحم:\nبفاء ومهملة مضمومتين بينهما سين مهملة ساكنة، بنت أوس «٣» ابن خولى بن عبد اللَّه بن الحارث الأنصاريّة. تقدّم ذكر نسبها في والدها. قال ابن حبيب:\nبايعت النبيّ ﵌، وهي من بني الحبلى.",
      "english": "11631—Fushum\n\nWith the fa and the undotted ha both bearing damma, and between them an undotted sin bearing sukun. She was the daughter of Aws [3] ibn Khawli ibn Abd Allah ibn al-Harith, an Ansari woman. Her lineage has already been mentioned in the entry on her father. Ibn Habib said: “She pledged allegiance to the Prophet (may Allah bless him and grant him peace), and she belonged to Banu al-Hubla.”",
